OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFine during
OL,6,Fthe evening with some clear spells.
OL,7,FTurning cloudier and windy later in
OL,8,Fthe night, with spells of rain
OL,9,Fbeginning to affect the northwest by
OL,10,Fdawn. Temperatures near average.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FSoon becoming wet and windy,
OL,13,Fthe rain persistent and heavy on
OL,14,Fhills. Eventually drier and brighter
OL,15,Ffor some as rain edges southwards,
OL,16,Feasing along with winds. Isolated
OL,17,Fshowers following.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
